WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Setup: everything you need for the exercises.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:12.101
Check the prerequisites: git, Docker with Compose, and uv.

3
00:00:12.152 --> 00:00:17.627
Open the workshop repository on GitHub and click Fork.

4
00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:22.127
Your fork is your own copy. You will push to it in the CI/CD chapter.

5
00:00:22.177 --> 00:00:29.193
Clone your fork and change into the folder.

6
00:00:29.243 --> 00:00:35.518
The install script installs the Data Contract CLI and the Data Product CLI.

7
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:42.762
Check the versions: 1.2.2 and 0.2.0.

8
00:00:42.812 --> 00:00:47.419
Start PostgreSQL. It comes preloaded with the orders data.

9
00:00:47.468 --> 00:00:54.870
A quick query shows 5000 orders.

10
00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:01.623
The .env file holds the database credentials. The CLIs read it automatically.

11
00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:04.622
Done. Next: put your data under contract.
